    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Filter which determines which <ref refid="classssa__private_1_1CFG" kindref="compound">CFG</ref> nodes appear in the CFg used to propagate reaching definitions. Getting this right is very important. If an AST node appears twice in the filtered <ref refid="classssa__private_1_1CFG" kindref="compound">CFG</ref>, reaching definitions will be propagated to it from two distinct locations. So, each AST node must appear at most once, (with the exception of SgFunctionDefinition) </para>    </detaileddescription>
